# Line endings.
#
# This repo is developed on Windows and deployed to Linux containers. A shell
# script checked out with CRLF fails inside a container with a confusing
# "bad interpreter" or syntax error, so the files that a container executes or
# parses are pinned to LF regardless of the platform they were written on.

* text=auto

*.sh            text eol=lf
dockerfile      text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.sql           text eol=lf
.env.example    text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
